        "TileImage": "$($repository 7271eae1-6bdd-4936-b763-b2390fb07fe7).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rYour targets today consist of five prominent members of the Whittleton Creek Homeowners Association. Apparently a dispute regarding the allowable height of a member&apos;s front lawn has reached a tipping point, and a sizable reward has been offered for the elimination of the opposing members.\r\rThe member who has taken out the contract insists that the utmost discretion be applied on the mission, in order to preserve the property value of the neighbourhood.\r\rBest of luck, 47.",
